  "summary": "Strictly, the direct matches are [V0048], [V0047], [V0046], and [V0045]: each applies representation learning with paired positive and negative examples to estimating agricultural yield. [V0048] reports the strongest classification result on ToxiBench (F1=0.83); [V0047] uses CellLife and reports AUROC=0.76; [V0046] uses LedgerGuard and reports test MAE=0.69; [V0045] uses AgriSat-4 but reports only accuracy=0.62. Because datasets and metrics are heterogeneous, this order is a relevance-first ranking rather than a like-for-like meta-analytic comparison. Prior-work mentions such as [V0015], [V0217], [V0066], and [V0158] are not applications and are not counted as direct evidence. To satisfy the required five-ID output, [V0040] is placed last only as a same-topic non-contrastive comparator: boosted decision-tree ensembles for estimating agricultural yield on ToxiBench with test MAE=0.61.",
